"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"921eb95cb8ac5110d1e00b2e41776561\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"e289d0378447c55975f0cd5e7bd19849\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">[1] <strong>黑龙江日报</strong>，霍明英为航天器“拟飞”创造环境，</span><a href=\"http://epaper.hljnews.cn/hljrb/20191124/450360.html\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">http://epaper.hljnews.cn/hljrb/20191124/450360.html</span></a> </p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250404/1743738419937072323.png\" title=\"1743738419937072323.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"294\" height=\"407\"></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">[2] <strong>哈工大研究生</strong>，霍明英教授：追风赶月莫停留，平芜尽处是春山，</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/97sZU_w_0PlKJVNeJc-sGQ\" style=\"text-decoration:underline; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/97sZU_w_0PlKJVNeJc-sGQ</span></a></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788404909344084412.png\" title=\"1788404909344084412.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">[3] <strong>新华社</strong>，从731遗址到哈工大航天馆：一堂场馆里的实景大思政课，<a href=\"https://h.xinhuaxmt.com/vh512/share/12068504?d=134d8ee&amp;channel=weixin\" target=\"_self\">https://h.xinhuaxmt.com/vh512/share/12068504?d=134d8ee&amp;channel=weixin</a></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://img-xhpfm.xinhuaxmt.com/News/202406/337b4cb442394e5fa7ae697034e384db.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1000/auto-orient,1/quality,Q_80\"></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">[4] <strong>央视新闻</strong>，关注春季招聘 黑龙江哈尔滨 AI职业咨询等就业服务 助力大学生求职，<a href=\"https://tv.cctv.com/2025/03/28/VIDE82sxvKBzQFCu6GNuHmrc250328.shtml\" target=\"_self\">https://tv.cctv.com/2025/03/28/VIDE82sxvKBzQFCu6GNuHmrc250328.shtml</a></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\"></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250404/1743739075213057155.jpg\" title=\"1743739075213057155.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20250329100947.jpg\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250404/1743739511534013420.jpg\" title=\"1743739511534013420.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20250329100947.jpg\" width=\"720\" height=\"413\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[</span>5] </span><strong style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">哈尔滨工业大学公众号</strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">，育人新星青年导师。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322501096015678.png\" title=\"1753322501096015678.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[6] <strong>中国新闻</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260525/1779671552175011139.jpg\" title=\"1779671552175011139.jpg\" alt=\"de0d7245c0b9c72a12d03e4fe8a424f3.jpg\" width=\"394\" height=\"632\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[7] <strong>黑龙江省共青团公众号</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788402178845096726.png\" title=\"1788402178845096726.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[8] <strong>哈工大公众号</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。</span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FjxrnxnHkCrWClFGCtLnjQ\">https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/FjxrnxnHkCrWClFGCtLnjQ</a> </p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788404049798021462.jpg\" title=\"1788404049798021462.jpg\" alt=\"a246aa5087011f97cafb6e5677604795.jpg\" width=\"532\" height=\"938\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[9] <strong>工信微报</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/Y7T3pbfZ2h9x8GK8DJWN_g</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788404808650079497.png\" title=\"1788404808650079497.png\" alt=\"8254728111130955ac84955e742382b7.png\" width=\"539\" height=\"1033\"><img src=\"https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/common/ueditor/themes/default/images/spacer.gif\" title=\"正在上传...\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[10] <strong>新青年杂志</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/HgcokCQHmYvKJ1KAaicGnQ</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788404619865037862.png\" title=\"1788404619865037862.png\" alt=\"d435f83aba1c56b912924efb8cfa8987.png\" width=\"465\" height=\"970\"></p>           <p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[11] <strong>龙江民盟</strong></span><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">。https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/mmBouc80KsSqcCyStS45jg</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260903/1788404628501002801.png\" title=\"1788404628501002801.png\" alt=\"a6c9afdf42e5095545c1cd5dc6984929.png\" width=\"744\" height=\"499\"></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb20150512110017370b7af5ac7e4122ae678fcceb5ac2fbpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"3ef107058f6e41caabf10bff7156a86e\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"d85be08e102549fcb50c99700115d171\">           <h3>一、招生人数</h3>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> 霍明英所在团队（航天学院飞行器机电一体化研究中心）每年可招收硕士研究生24名，博士研究生15名。并欢迎本科生提前进组实习，目前已有多位本科同学发表一区一作SCI论文，牵头获得挑战杯、国创赛、共创赛一等奖等奖励。</span></p>           <h3 style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\">二、主要招生方向</h3>           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">人工智能（算法应用）<br></span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">智能无人系统（无人机、无人车、机器人）</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"text-wrap:wrap; font-size:18px;\">无人集群智能任务决策与控制</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">电动帆、太阳帆动力学与控制</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">深空探测任务决策与轨迹优化</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">飞行器/航天器高保真微低重力模拟试验</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">固定翼/旋翼无人机智能回收</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">等离子推进无人机动力学及控制</span></p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">空间操控机器人任务规划及控制</span></p></li>           </ol>           <h3>三、可招生范围</h3>           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学校本部（哈尔滨）</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学苏州研究院（苏州）</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学重庆研究院（重庆）</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">哈尔滨工业大学郑州研究院（郑州）</span><br></p></li>           </ol>           <h3>四、支撑条件<br></h3>           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">实验室目前已配置有四台高性能工作站，后续计划增加部署四台。</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">实验室目前已搭建一套大型分布式无人集群仿真系统</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">实验室目前已搭建一套基于VR设备的虚拟仿真系统</span></p></li>            <li><p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">实验室具备各类飞行器/航天器地面模拟试验条件</span></p></li>           </ol>           <p><strong><br></strong></p>           <p><strong>注：上述各实验室设备均可由学生自主安排使用</strong></p>           <p><br></p>           <p>有意者请发送邮件至<a href=\"mailto:huomingying@hit.edu.cn\">huomingying@hit.edu.cn</a><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250902/1756778966070055678.png\" title=\"1756778966070055678.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">VR及机械臂操作试验系统</p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250723/1753249367320080234.jpg\" title=\"1753249367320080234.jpg\" alt=\"8b64e6326b76e4d3774849c706d1eb33.jpg\" width=\"777\" height=\"703\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">飞行器分布式仿真试验系统<img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322239216052762.png\" title=\"1753322239216052762.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322359495097035.png\" title=\"1753322359495097035.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"772\" height=\"345\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">咖啡机、跑步机、冰箱等设备</span><img src=\"https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322239216052762.png\" title=\"1753322239216052762.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322333285070548.png\" title=\"1753322333285070548.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"766\" height=\"470\"></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-align: center;\">大型计算服务器<img src=\"https://homepage.hit.edu.cn/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322239216052762.png\" title=\"1753322239216052762.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250902/1756779567522056691.jpg\" title=\"1756779567522056691.jpg\" alt=\"3e8988a1dd98cb4539aff85d54924a9.jpg\" width=\"749\" height=\"505\"></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap-mode: wrap; text-align: center;\">航天器气浮实验系统</p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753322433421007259.png\" title=\"1753322433421007259.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"416\"><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"tabb20150512105936370b7af5ac7e4122ae678fcceb5ac2fbpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3104\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3104\">奖项成果</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"新增\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl>        <ol id=\"8fd66d2398304476ade257da2ed06296\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"奖项名称\" data-zh=\"奖项名称\">            奖项名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           XXX装配及试验技术          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"获奖时间\" data-zh=\"获奖时间\">            获奖时间           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           2021年          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"完成人\" data-zh=\"完成人\">            完成人           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           霍明英（3/6）          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"所获奖项\" data-zh=\"所获奖项\">            所获奖项           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\">           国家技术发明二等奖          </div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" 