</div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"person in charge\" data-zh=\"完成人\">           完成人          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           霍明英（3/7）          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"received awards\" data-zh=\"所获奖项\">           所获奖项          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           黑龙江省专利银奖          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>        <ol id=\"157e43d9c685dc164dbd8ee9f9d84c28\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"award name\" data-zh=\"奖项名称\">           奖项名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           XXX微重力模拟技术          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"published time\" data-zh=\"获奖时间\">           获奖时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2015年          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"person in charge\" data-zh=\"完成人\">           完成人          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           霍明英（10/11）          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"received awards\" data-zh=\"所获奖项\">           所获奖项          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           黑龙江省技术发明一等奖          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">研究领域</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"8f412db33826431e847883664fd26425\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"dade08fa624e44a388109a0d9e79c121\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>一、人工智能理论及应用</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">1.1 生成式人工智能决策</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">1.2 智能轨迹预测</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">1.3 机器学习代理模型</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">1.4 智能故障诊断</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>二、空间智能态势感知、操控理论及试验</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">2.1 星群智能态势感知</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">2.2 空间多臂协同操控及在轨装配</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">2.3 仿生粘附空间操控</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">2.4 面向多目标抵近的任务分配及轨迹优化</span></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">2.5 空间细胞机器人理论及应用</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>三、无人集群系统智能任务决策与规划</strong><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.1 多智能体强化学习固定翼无人机集群任务决策</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.2 异构无人系统智能态势感知及任务分配</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.3 多无人机系统快速轨迹优化</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.4 等离子推进无人机技术（国内首飞）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.5 变形飞行器设计、建模与控制</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.6 固定翼/旋翼无人机智能回收</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">3.7 无人机智能机库研发</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>四、深空探测理论方法及试验</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">4.1 面向多小行星探测的智能任务决策</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">4.2 深空探测快速轨迹优化理论</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">4.3 电动帆、太阳帆多体动力学及轨迹优化</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">4.4 小行星表面巡游机器人智能任务规划与控制</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">4.5 超大型空间结构系统动力学与控制</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>五、飞行器气浮式零重力模拟试验技术</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.1 气悬浮核心器件研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.2 气浮平台研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.3 单轴气浮转台研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.4 气浮式三自由度平动/转动飞行器模拟器研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.5 气浮式五自由度飞行器模拟器研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.6 气浮式六自由度飞行器模拟器研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">5.7 天地一致性等效映射理论及应用</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>六、航天器悬吊式微低重力模拟试验技术</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">6.1 空间站机械臂微重力模拟系统研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">6.2 月球车/火星车低重力模拟系统厌烦</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">6.3 宇航员训练微重力模拟系统研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">6.4 大型空间结构地面等效模拟试验系统研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">6.5 面向航天科普的微低重力模拟系统研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\"><strong>七、虚拟装配及数字孪生技术</strong></span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">7.1 面向复杂产品的虚拟装配策略及验证研究</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">7.2 基于数字孪生的航天器全寿命性能评估和状态管理研究</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">7.3 飞行器总装生产线数字孪生系统研发</span></p>           <p style=\"white-space: normal; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun; font-size:16px;\">7.4 虚拟装配及数字孪生仿真软件平台开发</span></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\"> <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"999\">论文发表</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>         </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl style=\"\">         <ol id=\"5c4d1b9c99744ce0b9ea8fc865ca4108\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">          <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">           <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"名称\" data-zh=\"名称\">            名称           </div>           <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>          </div>          <div cla