and control of a position servo system in the zero gravity simulation of space manipulators[C]//2015 International Conference on Fluid Power and Mechatronics (FPM). IEEE, 2015: 501-504. (EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[88]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">彭福军</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵钧</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">等</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">电动帆航天器谷神星探测任务轨迹优化</span>[J]. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">宇航学报</span>, 2015, 36(12): 1363-1372.(<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">中文核心期刊，</span>EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[89]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">周啟航</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">张刘</span>, <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">等</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">弹道导弹中段突防弹道设计与验证</span>[J]. Optics and Precision Engineering, 2015, 23(9): 2645-2655.(<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">中文核心期刊，</span>EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[90]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span>Qi N, <strong>Huo M</strong>, Yuan Q. Displaced electric sail orbits design and transition trajectory optimization[J]. Mathematical Problems in Engineering, 2014, 2014(1): 932190.(SCI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索，影响因子：</span>1.363)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[91]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">高海波等</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">宇航空间机构悬吊法重力补偿关键技术</span>.<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">黑龙江省</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">哈尔滨工业大学</span>,2014-12-17.(<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">科技成果</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[92]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>, <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">袁秋帆</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">电动帆轨迹优化及其性能分析</span>[J]. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">宇航学报</span>, 2013, 34(5): 634-641.(<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">中文核心期刊，</span>EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[93]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">张文辉</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">马静</span>, <a><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong></a><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">等</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">空间微重力地面模拟试验系统智能控制器设计</span>[J]. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">哈尔滨工业大学学报</span>, 2012, 44(1): 17-21. (<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">中文核心期刊，</span>EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[94]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><strong>Mingying H</strong>, Naiming Q, Tianye W. Hybrid genetic algorithm gauss pseudospectral method for the electric sail trajectory optimization[C]//2012 Second International Conference on Instrumentation, Measurement, Computer, Communication and Control. IEEE, 2012: 318-322.(EI<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">检索</span>)</p>           <p class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0;text-align:left;line-height:150%;text-autospace:none\">[95]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">张文辉</span>, <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">高九州</span>, <strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">等</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">空间微重力环境地面模拟试验方法综述</span>[J]. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">航天控制</span>, 2011, 29(3): 95-100. (<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">中文核心期刊</span>)</p>           <p><br></p>          </div>          </div>         </ol>        </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">代表性专利</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"d30bbbb6d34a9375d05517d0c1838b90\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"3ceb68be3c665eb1bf24f133470d5a58\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></p>           <table width=\"756\">            <tbody>             <tr>              <td valign=\"top\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:20px;\">授权专利</span></td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"top\" rowspan=\"1\" colspan=\"5\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221);\"><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[1]<span style=\"font-style:normal; font-variant:normal; font-size-adjust:none; font-kerning:auto; font-feature-settings:normal; font-weight:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-size:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体, SimSun;\">齐乃明,徐喆垚,周啟航,齐骥,孙康,<strong>霍明英</strong>. 平面或曲面内无导轨二维运动物体的位移和姿态的非接触测量方法，<span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">ZL201410160571.1.</span></span></span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[2]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵钧</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙启龙</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">曹世磊</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">气浮式柔性装配对接系统，</span>ZL201610217882.6.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[3]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵立军</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">仿生粘附式尺蠖机器人，</span>ZL201610831942.3.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[4]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵钧</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">江左</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">触须粘附式大尺寸空间非合作目标快速消旋处理包，</span>ZL201610831943.8.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[5]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘如才</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">林海奇</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">基于气浮技术的模块式自动对接装配装置，</span>ZL201610896134.5.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[6]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">唐丽慧</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">袁秋帆</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">左湛</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种气浮球轴承三维姿态测量装置，</span>ZL201610899857.0.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[7]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">唐丽慧</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘如才</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种气浮球轴承三维姿态测量方法，</span>ZL201610899858.5.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[8]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙康</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">气悬浮系统的多气足过定位水平共面调节方法，</span>ZL201610901985.4. </span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[9]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">张勇</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙丽雯</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">林海奇</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">三自由度双体卫星隔振地面试验系统，</span>ZL201610915539.9.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[10]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘如才</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">多节流孔组合式的过缝能力增强型气足，</span>ZL201610921427.4.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[11]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙康</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">张宁波</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">多圈独立供气的过缝能力增强型气足，</span>ZL201610921429.3.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[12]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">尹宇磊</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">用于柔性制造的视觉测量装置及方法，</span>ZL201610956260.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[13]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵钧</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">曹世磊</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘永孛</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">大质偏工件质心高精度测量装置，</span>ZL201710137565.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[14]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">姚蔚然</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵钧</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙康</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">徐嵩</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">基于平动气浮支撑的扭摆式细长体轴向转动惯量测量装置，</span>ZL201710137018.X.</span></p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">[15]<span style=\"font:9px;\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font