style=\"font-family:宋体;\">李铮</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">孙康</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种基于改进</span>Blensor<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">软件的空间态势感知模拟系统，</span>CN202411072008.9.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[40]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">晏卓雯</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">陈磊</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种优化雷达隐身材料覆膜配比算法，</span>CN202411092715.4.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[41]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">金如浩</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">陈磊</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">冯文煜</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">于泽</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">哑铃型卫星模拟器重力干扰力矩高精度动态补偿系统，</span>CN202411107124.X.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[42]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">杨殿亮</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘一骄</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">周芮</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种飞行器的故障检测装置及方法，</span>CN202411144500.2.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[43]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">范子琛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">付翌航</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">金如浩</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">石雨豪</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种基于贝塞尔形函数法的密集脉冲转移轨道设计方法，</span>CN202411144497.4.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[44]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">苏麟力</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">范子琛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">杨列</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">冯文煜</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种基于有限元法的双小行星系统探测器轨道设计方法，</span>CN202411241241.5.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[45]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">赵阳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘一骄</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王成</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王建锋</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种变翼展飞行器气动外形补偿增稳装置，</span>CN202411324923.2.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[46]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">马艺森</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐骥</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">李铮</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">范子琛</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种基于粒子群算法的拉普拉斯极短弧定轨算法，</span>CN202411350775.1.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[47]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">金如浩</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">杨列</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">冯文煜</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种哑铃型卫星模拟器重力干扰力矩高精度动态补偿算法，</span>CN202411412348.1.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[48]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">英毓龙</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王建锋</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王业光</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王世鹏</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">林桐</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种基于</span>PWM<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">脉宽调制的等离子推进控制系统，</span>CN202411560294.3.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[49]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">潘贵琪</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">于泽</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王建锋</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种模糊免疫控制优化</span>PID<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">的无人机俯仰控制方法及系统，</span>CN202411560295.8.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[50]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">周芮</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">佘佳宇</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王飞阳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">杜德嵩</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种考虑相似性和多样性的航天器目标检测方法，</span>CN202411703772.1.</p><p style=\"margin-left:0;line-height:150%\">[51]<span style=\"font:9px 'Times New Roman';\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">刘延芳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">周芮</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">佘佳宇</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">王飞阳</span>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">莫丽东</span>,<strong><span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">霍明英</span></strong>,<span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">齐乃明</span>. <span style=\"font-family:宋体;\">一种结合语义分割和图像语义映射大模型的零样本航天器目标检测方法，</span>CN202411703777.4.</p></td>             </tr>            </tbody>           </table>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><br></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>       <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">        <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">         <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3105\"></i><em id=\"3105\" data-more=\"1\">代表性科研项目</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>         <div class=\"part_r\"> <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"新增\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>         </div>        </div>        <dl>        <ol id=\"04ff94fa4d678ace8254f11ee485ae66\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project name\" data-zh=\"项目名称\">           项目名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           航天器编队构型快速优化与重构技术研究          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project source\" data-zh=\"项目来源\">           项目来源          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           中华人民共和国科学技术部，国家重点研发计划青年科学家项目          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"start time\" data-zh=\"开始时间\">           开始时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2024.12          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"end time\" data-zh=\"结束时间\">           结束时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2029.11          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project fund\" data-zh=\"项目经费\">           项目经费          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"担任角色\" data-lis-zh=\"负责,参与\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"role\" data-zh=\"担任角色\">           担任角色          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           负责          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"项目类别\" data-lis-zh=\"横向项目,纵向项目\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"classification\" data-zh=\"项目类别\">           项目类别          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           纵向项目          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"项目状态\" data-lis-zh=\"完成,进行中\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"status\" data-zh=\"项目状态\">           项目状态          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           进行中          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           研究背景：空间引力波探测系统通常由相距十几万到上百万公里的三颗航天器组成，当引力波通过该探测系统时，航天器间惯性参考质量沿测量敏感轴方向的距离会发生变化，通过高精度激光干涉测量该距离变化来进行引力波探测。为降低各种环境噪声影响及长时间的引力波探测，卫星编队需要在无拖曳控制下保持几个月至几年的深空轨道稳定编队构型，这对空间引力波探测任务中编队构型稳定性、入轨精度、构型重构技术提出了极高要求。研究航天器编队构型快速优化与重构技术对未来开展空间引力波探测任务将提供重要的技术支撑。          </div>         </div>        </ol>        <ol id=\"d4d18a6b3abe2af1c9bfe059bbaa2c16\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project name\" data-zh=\"项目名称\">           项目名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           面向空间多源威胁感知的星群数字孪生建模及协同计算方法研究          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project source\" data-zh=\"项目来源\">           项目来源          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           国家自然科学基金委员会，联合基金项目          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"start time\" data-zh=\"开始时间\">           开始时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2023.01          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"end time\" data-zh=\"结束时间\">           结束时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2026.12          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"project fund\" data-zh=\"项目经费\">           项目经费          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"担任角色\" data-lis-zh=\"负责,参与\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"role\" data-zh=\"担任角色\">           担任角色          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           参与          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"项目类别\" data-lis-zh=\"横向项目,纵向项目\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"classification\" data-zh=\"项目类别\">           项目类别          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           纵向项目          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"form_radio\" data-label=\"项目状态\" data-lis-zh=\"完成,进行中\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"status\" data-zh=\"项目状态\">           项目状态          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           进行中          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      </ul>     </div>     <div id=\"426c1607417d1ad31b148d2b91f7b731part\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">主要成员</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"91f9b82f1452604f64df9912eabe1bed\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"fc5003134af0688697115fa1b717f2da\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">飞行器机电一体化中心下的飞行器试验及特种无人机组由霍明英负责，组内团队成员主要包括：</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>【教授博导】霍明英</strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>【春雁副研究员】范子琛，齐骥 ，冯文煜，金如浩</strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>【博士生】</strong>于泽，徐嵩，赵策，林桐，刘一骄，李铮，杨列，陈磊，乔云一，齐博，杨乃汉，李铭，赵博程，杨殿亮，王成，赵福友，薛驭风，赵阳，苏麟力，尚霄宇，王天晨，顾浩鹏，高志博，姚理，<span style=\"\">张一鸣，邓嘉宁，吴永成，姚宇轩，石雨豪，</span>夏莹东，潘贵琪，付翌航，邱继栋，张宝琛，孙敏健，王翊，姚博锐，赵汗青，岳佳琦，温永泰，谢亚勋</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>【硕士生】</strong>柯伟钦，马艺森，晏卓雯，薛文林，关腾飞，唱响，王真，王旭，陈隆昀，莫怀然，姜钧昊，刘玉泽，焦彦淞，魏晓杰，郑志健，黄于浩，周子睿，曾霖杰，郭马路，李聚阳，张扬，方汶琪，史航，杨舒涵，王慧滔，郝晓宇，叶玄博，李鹤立，朱泽楷，柴豪政，闫乙朔，江哲，朱雨成，卜祥仲</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><br></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>【优秀学生代表】</strong></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>范子琛：</strong>2018级博士研究生，主要从事航天器动力学及控制、无人机飞行控制及先进回收技术研究。发表一作或通讯SCI论文15篇，其中TOP期刊5篇，JCR一区8篇，授权发明专利10余项，出版专著2部。入选第十届中国科协青年人才托举工程、中国宇航学会首届高水平博士学位论文激励计划、龙江科技英 才春雁支持计划，获中国发明协会发明创业奖创新奖一等奖、省教学成果一等奖、省一流课程、全国空间轨道设计竞赛冠军、哈工大优秀博士学位论文、哈工大研究生十佳英才、哈工大优秀学生李昌奖 等荣誉奖励。主持国家自然科学基金青年基金、国家重点研发计划青年科学家项目子课题等项目17项。</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><strong>金如浩：</strong>2022级博士研究生，主要从事连续小推力航天器快速轨迹优化及轨迹解析研究，发表9篇论文，授权2项专利，获得博士研究生国家奖学金、第十三届中国空间轨道设计竞赛二等奖等奖励。已获批春雁计划预留师资，将作为副研究员留校工作，并获CSC留学基金委资助，将赴意大利留学。</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"\"></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em; text-wrap-mode: wrap;\"><strong>姚博锐</strong>：2021级本科生姚博锐，主要从事航天器快速轨迹优化等相关研究，两篇SCItop期刊在投（AST， CJA），AFC 2025会议最佳论文，全国高等学校航空航天类专业本科生毕业设计成果交流会二等奖，校百优本科毕设；获得周培源力学竞赛国家一等奖，周培源力学竞赛“空间轨道设计”赛题二等奖 （全国第四），中国空间轨道设计竞赛三等奖（全国第七）。</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">【国家奖学金获得者】范子琛（博士）、金如浩<span style=\"\">（博士）</span>、冯文煜<span style=\"\">（硕士）</span>、赵福友<span style=\"\">（硕士）</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">【校优秀博士学位论文获得者】范子琛</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">【<span style=\"\">校优秀硕士学位论文获得者</span>】赵福友</p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\">【<span style=\"\">校百优本科毕设获得者</span>】乔云一，<span style=\"\">姚宇轩，<span style=\"\">苏桓立，姚博锐</span></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20231101/1698823882783009663.png\" title=\"1698823882783009663.png\" alt=\"1698823855222.png\" width=\"765\" height=\"343\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20231101/1698823863031092046.png\" title=\"1698823863031092046.png\" alt=\"1698823855222.png\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250403/1743646199462029393.jpg\" title=\"1743646199462029393.jpg\" alt=\"6660c28fb1ee4356bd5dde1be47c569.jpg\" width=\"765\" height=\"506\"></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260525/1779671349438016454.png\" title=\"1779671349438016454.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"764\" height=\"383\"></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">学生指导</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"7d23bb8743002fa13c96e18715bf1b0f\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"84054ec0cbba6f32b8bc44b154e5a500\">           <p><br></p>           <table>            <tbody>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体;\">“挑战杯”大学生课外学术科技作品竞赛（黑龙江省赛区）</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">一等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2025</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体;\">中国国际大学生创新大赛（</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:'Times New Roman',serif;\">2025</span><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体;\">）黑龙江赛区</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">金奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2025</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:宋体;\">教育部第六届全国高等学校航空航天类专业本科毕业设计成果</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">特等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2025</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">中国大学生工程实践与创新能力大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">金 奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">第十三届全国空间轨道设计竞赛（甲组）</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">第十三届全国空间轨道设计竞赛（丙组）</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">三等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">“未来之光超算杯”第十届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">三等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">中国宇航学会空间太阳能电站青年创新竞赛<br></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">第六届”开拓杯“未来飞行器设计大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">第五届全国高校航空航天类专业本科毕业设计成果交流会</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">优秀奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2024</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2023年中国大学生工程实践与创新能力大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">特等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2023</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"\">第四届全国高校航空航天类专业本科毕业设计成果交流会</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-width:1px; word-break:break-all; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2023</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">2023年世界大学生立方星挑战赛（中国区）</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><p style=\"line-height: normal;\">三等奖</p></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2023</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">“新动航空杯”第九届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2023</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"533\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">“申浩杯”第五届中国研究生机器人创新设计大赛</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"94\" align=\"center\">一等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"86\" align=\"center\">2023</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">“三江杯”第八届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">二等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" colspan=\"1\" rowspan=\"1\" style=\"border-left:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); border-top:1px solid rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-right-width:1px; border-bottom-width:1px; border-right-style:solid; border-bottom-style:solid;\" align=\"center\">2022</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"528\" align=\"center\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">“三江杯”第八届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛</span></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"94\" align=\"center\">一等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"86\" align=\"center\">2022</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"529\" align=\"center\">“航天四部开拓杯”未来飞行器设计大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"94\" align=\"center\">特等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"86\" align=\"center\">2022</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"533\" align=\"center\">第十届全国空间轨道设计竞赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"94\" align=\"center\">一等奖<br></td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"86\" align=\"center\">2019</td>             </tr>             <tr>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"533\" align=\"center\">“罗麦杯”第四届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"94\" align=\"center\">三等奖</td>              <td valign=\"middle\" style=\"border-color:rgb(221, 221, 221); word-break:break-all; border-width:1px; border-style:solid;\" width=\"86\" align=\"center\">2017<br></td>             </tr>            </tbody>           </table>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">竞赛获奖</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"58bd9a029d4358c239cbdfebba897876\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"da285c0b5c1a9a42306170070bd05b24\">           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196946542007283.jpg\" title=\"1768196946542007283.jpg\" alt=\"微信图片_20260112134415_217_175.jpg\" width=\"786\" height=\"489\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147443912018241.jpg\" title=\"1717147443912018241.jpg\" width=\"687\" height=\"746\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147444174091949.jpg\" title=\"1717147444174091949.jpg\" width=\"666\" height=\"417\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147444389021881.png\" title=\"1717147444389021881.png\" width=\"607\" height=\"474\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147444413064079.jpg\" title=\"1717147444413064079.jpg\" width=\"565\" height=\"386\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147444502079416.jpg\" title=\"1717147444502079416.jpg\" width=\"444\" height=\"589\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20240531/1717147444754001472.jpg\" title=\"1717147444754001472.jpg\" width=\"562\" height=\"374\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.5em;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660093090846058004.png\" title=\"1660093090846058004.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"767\" height=\"367\"><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2020年 范子琛（导师齐乃明，副导师霍明英）获哈尔滨工业大学十佳英才</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660103618062014024.png\" title=\"1660103618062014024.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2020年 范子琛接受新华社专访报道</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660103726935088477.png\" title=\"1660103726935088477.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"765\" height=\"387\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2019年 第十届全国空间轨道竞赛冠军<br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660103817259001169.png\" title=\"1660103817259001169.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"768\" height=\"426\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2017年 中国研究生未来飞行器大赛三等奖<br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660103884354089104.png\" title=\"1660103884354089104.png\" alt=\"image.png\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">2022年 “航天四部开拓杯”未来飞行器设计大赛特等奖</p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299476343025844.jpg\" title=\"1693299476343025844.jpg\" alt=\"1502da51aae2a39f5047c36a2b1738d.jpg\" width=\"742\" height=\"474\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\">2022年 “三江杯”第八届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛一等奖</span></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299027847040016.jpg\" title=\"1693299027847040016.jpg\" alt=\"037f0d4b17a658f67409082c20c65be.jpg\" width=\"762\" height=\"473\"></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center;\">2023年 “申浩杯”第五届中国研究生机器人创新设计大赛一等奖</p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap;\"><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299234054054330.jpg\" title=\"1693299234054054330.jpg\" alt=\"5ec98d3c53efce6ec15c1986547cc03.jpg\" width=\"771\" height=\"592\"></p>           <p style=\"text-wrap: wrap; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center;\">2023年 “新动航空杯”第九届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛二等奖</span><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299320697075259.jpg\" title=\"1693299320697075259.jpg\" alt=\"319cba413524bbe94943a53448c4d16.jpg\" width=\"768\" height=\"596\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\">2023年 “新动航空杯”第九届中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛一等奖</span></p>           <p><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\"><br></span></p>           <p><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299367290055091.jpg\" title=\"1693299367290055091.jpg\" alt=\"e36cc0f97083b9f699438f9aa267f5c.jpg\" width=\"764\" height=\"519\"></span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\">2023年世界大学生立方星挑战赛中国区三等奖</span></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"text-align:center; text-wrap:wrap;\"><br></span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">团队活动</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"f31ffc5702cc6347a84b0cecffb49992\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"da9e5afcbea9fafe8bdc6982bc7dbcb4\">           <p>飞行器机电一体化中心下的飞行器试验及特种无人机组定期进行组内研讨会，并开展丰富多彩团队活动。</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196785181048321.jpg\" title=\"1768196785181048321.jpg\" width=\"777\" height=\"533\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196785181006878.jpg\" title=\"1768196785181006878.jpg\" width=\"774\" height=\"603\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196785181096218.jpg\" title=\"1768196785181096218.jpg\" width=\"772\" height=\"610\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196785330073285.jpg\" title=\"1768196785330073285.jpg\" width=\"772\" height=\"609\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20260112/1768196785333093914.jpg\" title=\"1768196785333093914.jpg\" width=\"775\" height=\"623\"></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250724/1753320556447045256.png\" title=\"1753320556447045256.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"757\" height=\"480\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104075917004008.png\" title=\"1660104075917004008.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"773\" height=\"413\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">集体参观龙塔<br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250721/1753083226650043939.png\" title=\"1753083226650043939.png\" alt=\"1753083224320.png\" width=\"777\" height=\"424\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">东北虎林园<br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20250721/1753083279152040027.png\" title=\"1753083279152040027.png\" alt=\"1753083274209.png\" width=\"775\" height=\"683\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">雪花摩天轮<br></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104220830018743.png\" title=\"1660104220830018743.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"771\" height=\"453\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">沙滩烧烤组会<br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104478733012420.png\" title=\"1660104478733012420.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"431\" height=\"329\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104500779026381.png\" title=\"1660104500779026381.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"331\" height=\"330\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299560388093671.jpg\" title=\"1693299560388093671.jpg\" alt=\"bf9e5e22a271c67ae7004191bf07841.jpg\" width=\"770\" height=\"524\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299608830087673.png\" title=\"1693299608830087673.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"764\" height=\"536\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299639455005750.jpg\" title=\"1693299639455005750.jpg\" alt=\"4337e5abd23a8620787b24e3e108a0b.jpg\" width=\"764\" height=\"640\"></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299657835024668.jpg\" title=\"1693299657835024668.jpg\" alt=\"60649c582af99d5508742f50517e614.jpg\" width=\"755\" height=\"825\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\">轰趴馆组会</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104576719033951.png\" title=\"1660104576719033951.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"776\" height=\"558\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">文体活动：滑雪</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20220810/1660104635470027443.png\" title=\"1660104635470027443.png\" alt=\"image.png\" width=\"773\" height=\"495\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">文体活动：保龄球</p>           <p><br></p>           <p><br></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299796722006794.jpg\" title=\"1693299796722006794.jpg\" alt=\"7bc608b2d2e2eabdb2051b790484103.jpg\" width=\"757\" height=\"504\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"/ueditor/jsp/upload/image/20230829/1693299818411002182.jpg\" title=\"1693299818411002182.jpg\" alt=\"67969fd7bdc610a0ff738cad8d85579.jpg\" width=\"762\" height=\"579\"></p>           <p style=\"text-align: center;\">科研活动：学术会议</p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"df5c418d5614151690219cd799177f8cpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3201\"></i><em id=\"3201\" data-more=\"0\">教学概况</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"5d2e8ae188a3376cf184ddb1a732f02d\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"course name\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"ab6df5265efcdccfedc011d38bf8214a\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.75em;\"><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"> 霍明英，作为飞行器设计类专业教学主任，担任善义班、未来技术学院拔尖班、航天学院飞行器设计专业核心课任课教师，讲授《航天器轨道动力学》等课程长期评价结果为A</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">，并入选国家级一流线下课程，曾获黑龙江省教学成果一等奖、哈尔滨工业大学教学成果特等奖等奖励</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">。</span></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3002\"></i><em data-editor=\"0\" data-more=\"1\" id=\"3002\">荣誉称号</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_icon_add\" title=\"添加\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_add\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><i class=\"part_icon_solid\"></i><a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl>        <ol id=\"1dbf5c465d33c477d6236833a6c5e11b\" class=\"rych\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"称号名称\">           称号名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           哈尔滨工业大学立德树人先进个人          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"acquisition time\" data-zh=\"获奖时间\">           获奖时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2023年教师节          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"acquisition address\" data-zh=\"获奖地点\">           获奖地点          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           哈尔滨工业大学          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>        <ol id=\"bd047265a55a62b00931cf27f30a2f64\" class=\"rych\" style=\"padding-left:70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"称号名称\">           称号名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           哈尔滨工业大学育人新星青年导师          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"acquisition time\" data-zh=\"获奖时间\">           获奖时间          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           2023年          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"acquisition address\" data-zh=\"获奖地点\">           获奖地点          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\">           哈尔滨工业大学          </div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"\" data-domtype=\"textarea\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"introduction\" data-zh=\"简单介绍\">           简单介绍          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">主讲课程</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"95a659ba796d1f233562748e6064321a\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"91b295924b8be18ef33c4201c67c002f\">           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p>善义班专业核心课，《飞行器设计基础》，32学时</p></li>            <li><p>未来技术学院飞行器设计专业核心课，《<span style=\"\">飞行器创新设计与实践</span>》，8学时<br></p></li>            <li><p>本科专业核心课，《航天器轨道动力学》，32学时。</p></li>            <li><p>本科文化素质核心课，《探索浩瀚星空：世界深空探测发展史》，16学时。</p></li>            <li><p>硕士研究生核心课，《航天器机电系统设计与仿真》，16学时。</p></li>            <li><p>硕士研究生专题课，《新概念飞行器专题》，16学时。<br></p></li>           </ol>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">教学奖励</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"da9aec646ce65f6436efcfe973bbb3f8\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"a6dc624beed09da4507b7246ad21840b\">           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1. 【教学成果奖】黑龙江省教学成果一等奖</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2. 【教学成果奖】哈尔滨工业大学教学成果特等奖</span></span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3.【教学竞赛获奖】霍明英，航天器轨道动力学，哈尔滨工业大学航天学院教学基本功竞赛一等奖，2022年.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4.【教学竞赛获奖】霍明英，探索浩瀚星空：世界深空探测发展史，哈尔滨工业大学航天学院课程思政教学竞赛一等奖，2021年.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">5. 【教学竞赛获奖】霍明英，探索浩瀚星空：世界深空探测发展史，哈尔滨工业大学课程思政教学竞赛二等奖，2021年.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">6.霍明英，<span style=\"font-size:16px; font-variant-numeric:normal; font-variant-east-asian:normal; font-stretch:normal; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">中国研究生未来飞行器创新大赛优秀指导教师，2020年.</span></span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif; font-size:16px;\">7.霍明英，获2020年度哈尔滨工业大学优秀思想工作者，2020年.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px; font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">8.霍明英，获2019年度哈尔滨工业大学优秀思想工作者，2019年.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">教学项目</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"c11185112c21d8b0a536a37d78c77bae\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"80b7daadf60d103de88a5e317b8c14af\">           <ol class=\"list-paddingleft-2\" style=\"list-style-type:decimal; padding-left:70px;\">            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\">霍明英，“思创融合”促进航天卓越人才培养新模式的探索与实践，黑龙江省高等教育教学改革项目，2022年。</p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\">霍明英，探索浩瀚星空：世界深空探测发展史，哈尔滨工业大学教学发展基金项目，2020年。</p></li>            <li><p style=\"line-height: 1.5em;\">霍明英，小型航天器双星编队相对轨道动力学与控制地面模拟仿真实验系统，哈尔滨工业大学自制实验教学仪器设备研究项目，2022年。</p></li>           </ol>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon999\"></i><em id=\"999\" data-more=\"0\">教学论文</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"2bf0b4db230524e16c8f63269e4f0240\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"06f866b4b9cb14b63d01b83949507cf4\">           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">1.霍明英等. 世界深空探测发展史中的课程思政建设与思考，教育进展，2021,11(5):1-5.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">2.霍明英等. 轨道竞赛的启示：学科竞赛促进创新人才培养, 航空航天教学指导委员会论文集，2020年，南京.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">3.霍明英等，“思创融合”促进航天卓越人才培养新模式的探索与实践，第三届航空航天课程思政会议论文集，2022年，西安.</span></p>           <p style=\"font-size: medium; white-space: normal; margin-left: 0.25in; line-height: 1.5em;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">4.霍明英等，追风赶月莫停留，平芜尽处是春山，《中国研究生》杂志，2022年，哈尔滨</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>    <div id=\"d4f21de7c9f8cbc0ca3216c26d06bdfbpart\" class=\"part_box\" style=\"display: none;\">      <ul class=\"tacherContent_parts\" id=\"tacherContent_parts\" style=\"\">      <li class=\"con_parts\" style=\"display:block;\">       <div class=\"part_t\" style=\"background-color:rgb(39, 111, 181);\">        <div class=\"part_t_l\">         <i class=\"title_svg template_icon3202\"></i><em data-editor=\"1\" data-more=\"0\" id=\"3202\">招生信息</em><i class=\"part_icon part_icon_e1\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i>        </div>        <div class=\"part_r\">         <a id=\"part_card_top\" onclick=\"part_card_top(this)\" title=\"置顶\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_top\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_up\" onclick=\"part_card_up(this)\" title=\"上移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_up\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_down\" onclick=\"part_card_down(this)\" title=\"下移\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_down\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_card_bottom\" onclick=\"part_card_bottom(this)\" title=\"置底\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_bottom\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a><a id=\"part_icon_d\" title=\"删除\"><i class=\"part_icon1 part_icon_d\" style=\"display:flex;\"></i></a>        </div>       </div>       <dl style=\"\">        <ol id=\"b8888a85a74f7d51e1361ca0f818d98b\" style=\"padding-left: 70px;\">         <div class=\"card_view\" data-olname=\"olName\" data-domtype=\"input\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"model_title\" data-en=\"title\" data-zh=\"名称\">           名称          </div>          <div class=\"ol_value\"></div>         </div>         <div class=\"card_view\" data-domtype=\"editor_controls\" style=\"display:none;\">          <div class=\"editor_content\" id=\"e6c6e9e951659d508539301162f0ba63\">           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 16px;\"><strong>Huo Mingying</strong>, male, majoring in Aerospace Science and Technology, long-term professor, doctoral supervisor, national high-level young talent, national key research and development program young scientist; Deputy Director of the Employment Guidance Center and Deputy Director of the Aerospace Engineering Department at Harbin Institute of Technology (in charge of undergraduate teaching in aircraft design). Member of the China Young Science and Technology Workers Association, member of the Space Intelligence Special Committee of the Chinese Society of Space Sciences, member of the Low Altitude Industry Working Committee of the Chinese Equipment and Command Society, member of the Chinese Society of Astronautics, and young editorial board member of the Journal of Astronautics (Chinese and English versions) and Astrodynamics.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 16px;\">In terms of academic research, mainly engaged in the dynamics and control of new spacecraft, orbit design and optimization of deep space exploration vehicles, intelligent task planning and control of autonomous unmanned systems, in orbit service and intelligent control of space robots, space intelligent situational awareness and decision-making, ground high fidelity low gravity simulation experiments of spacecraft, intelligent recovery of fixed wing/rotary wing unmanned aerial vehicles and research and development of special unmanned aerial vehicles, generative artificial intelligence and digital twins, etc; Published over 100 academic papers, including more than 60 SCI indexed papers, 25 papers in top aerospace journals such as JGCD, IEEE TAES, AST, etc., cited over 500 times in SCI, published two monographs, and obtained over 60 authorized national invention patents.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 16px;\">In terms of scientific research projects, as the project leader, I have led and undertaken more than 30 important projects such as national ministry projects, national key R&amp;D program young scientist projects, national major science and technology infrastructure project key experimental systems, Mars exploration engineering technical transformation projects, national natural science foundation key project sub projects, and youth projects. I have also participated in multiple national important model tasks such as the Yutu lunar rover, Zhurong Mars rover, and space station core module robotic arm; Has won 1 second prize for national technological invention, 3 first prizes for provincial and ministerial level technological invention, and 1 silver patent award in Heilongjiang Province.</span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 16px;\"><br></span></p>           <p style=\"line-height: 1.5em; text-align: left;\"><span style=\"font-family: timesNewRoman; font-size: 16px;\">In terms of guidance and competition, it has successively won the first prize of Heilongjiang Province's teaching achievement, the first prize of the ideological and political competition of the virtual teaching and research section of the Ministry of Education, the special prize of Harbin Institute of Technology's teaching achievement, the exemplary individual of Harbin Institute of Technology's morality and talent cultivation, the top ten ideological and political education instructors, the young mentor of the new star of education, the outstanding ideological and political worker of the university, the first prize of the basic teaching skills competition of the Aerospace Academy and other honors; Hosted nine teaching projects including the Key Education Reform Project of the Chinese Society of Higher Education and the Heilongjiang Province Education Reform Project, published four teaching papers, taught courses selected as demonstration courses for aerospace majors by the Ministry of Education and first-class courses in Heilongjiang Province, edited textbooks selected as planned textbooks by the Ministry of Industry and Information Technology, guided students to win the National Gold Award and Provincial Special Award of the China University Student Engineering Practice and Innovation Ability Competition, the Provincial Gold Award of the Challenge Cup National University Student Innovation Competition, the Provincial First Prize of the China International University Student Innovation Competition, the First Prize, Second Prize, Third Prize of the China Graduate Future Aircraft Competition, the Best Physical Demonstration Award, the Special Prize of the \"Aerospace Exploration Cup\" Future Aircraft Design Competition, the First Prize of the \"Soaring Cup\" Cube Star and Application Innovation Design Competition More than 40 competition awards, including the second prize of the Zhou Peiyuan Mechanics Competition Track Design Team Competition, have been awarded, and honors such as Outstanding Guidance Teacher and Outstanding Worker have been obtained in the China Graduate Future Aircraft Competition; Collaborated with Professor Zhang Gang to guide students to win the championship of the 10th National Space Orbital Competition (the first championship of Harbin Institute of Technology); Guided students to win one special prize and two second prizes at the National Higher Education Institutions Aerospace Undergraduate Graduation Design Achievement Exchange Conference organized by the Ministry of Education. Multiple individuals have been awarded national scholarships for doctoral and master's students, provincial \"Three Good Students,\" excellent doctoral thesis, excellent master's thesis, and 100 excellent undergraduate thesis by the university.</span></p>           <p><br></p>          </div>         </div>        </ol>       </dl></li>     </ul>    </div>   </div>   </div> </body></html>"